.SS "\fBenum\fP \fBaiDefaultLogStream\fP"

.PP
Enumerates predefined log streaming destinations\&. Logging to these streams can be enabled with a single call to #LogStream::createDefaultStream\&. 
.PP
\fBEnumerator\fP
.in +1c
.TP
\fB\fIaiDefaultLogStream_FILE \fP\fP
Stream the log to a file 
.TP
\fB\fIaiDefaultLogStream_STDOUT \fP\fP
Stream the log to std::cout 
.TP
\fB\fIaiDefaultLogStream_STDERR \fP\fP
Stream the log to std::cerr 
.TP
\fB\fIaiDefaultLogStream_DEBUGGER \fP\fP
MSVC only: Stream the log the the debugger (this relies on OutputDebugString from the Win32 SDK) 
.SS "\fBenum\fP \fBaiOrigin\fP"
Seek origins (for the virtual file system API)\&. Much cooler than using SEEK_SET, SEEK_CUR or SEEK_END\&. 
.PP
\fBEnumerator\fP
.in +1c
.TP
\fB\fIaiOrigin_SET \fP\fP
Beginning of the file 
.TP
\fB\fIaiOrigin_CUR \fP\fP
Current position of the file pointer 
.TP
\fB\fIaiOrigin_END \fP\fP
End of the file, offsets must be negative 
